==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*30 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*15 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Henry]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the Crocos and Imperator Saels for money at the beginning. Once Henry spawns, clear the enemies in the way and rush his blindspot with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] and any other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] you may have. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] also does decently well here if you can time him in between Henry's blindspot and use a [[Burrow|burrowing]]/unburrowing Zroco as a stepping stone. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] makes this stage fairly trivial, but [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] and/or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] are also good choices. Otherwise, it's basically just a race to destroy the base, use as many [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|freeze immune units]] as you need such as [[Li'l Tank Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Eraser Cat]].

